window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When the past resurfaces, the truth threatens to drown them both.</p> <p>Just when Deana begins to feel the fragile threads of connection returning, fate tears her and Havard apart once more. But this time, the stakes are even higher. An unexpected encounter at the loch unearths long-buried truths—about Havard, their shared ancestry, and the powerful forces that have been shaping their lives from the shadows.</p> <p>As their worlds begin to unravel, Deana must navigate revelations that shake the foundation of everything she thought she knew. The ethereal realm she’s only begun to trust now teeters on the brink of collapse, and her bond with Havard may not survive what the truth reveals.</p> <p>Caught between destiny and desire, myth and memory, Deana must decide whether love can endure when everything else falls away.</p> <p>In <i>The Loch</i>, the mysteries deepen, the emotional stakes rise, and the line between worlds thins to breaking. For listeners who crave atmospheric romance laced with ancient magic, this is where everything begins to shift.</p>"; 
